00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:25.119
which is these public announcements about
investigations into Joe and Hunter Biden for

00:00:25.119 --> 00:00:32.870
the purposes of smearing the Bidens and helping
Donald Trump in 2020 and it's almost anticlimactic

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:38.240
to report this to you because anybody who
had been following the story, uh, with, with

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:43.329
some level of closeness and has been following
Donald Trump for three years or longer would

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:45.691
understand that that's exactly how it went
down.

00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:50.690
And these are what can potentially be called
